# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEXUS MARKET INTELLIGENCE — API KEYS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your keys.
# All keys below are FREE — no credit card required.

# ── FINNHUB ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get yours at: https://finnhub.io/register (free, instant)
# Provides: real-time quotes, company news + sentiment, earnings
# Free tier: 60 API calls/minute — more than enough
FINNHUB_API_KEY=your_finnhub_key_here

# ── ALPHA VANTAGE ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get yours at: https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
# Provides: 20+ years of historical OHLCV data
# Free tier: 25 requests/day (used as historical data fallback)
ALPHA_VANTAGE_KEY=your_alpha_vantage_key_here

# ── FRED (Federal Reserve Economic Data) ─────────────────────
# Get yours at: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
# Provides: 840,000 macroeconomic series — VIX, yield curve,
#           CPI, unemployment, Fed Funds Rate, and more
# Free: completely free, takes 1 minute to register
FRED_API_KEY=your_fred_key_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NO KEY REQUIRED (used automatically):
# • CoinGecko API   — crypto prices & market caps
# • Alternative.me  — CNN Fear & Greed Index
# • US Treasury     — live yield curve data
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
